&P235696 = Fs Pettinato 042, 1 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 2(disz) udu niga e2-muhaldim 
#tr.en: 2 grain-fed sheep (to) the kitchen, 
2. mu gu-un-da lu2 hu-ur5-ti{ki}-sze3 
#tr.en: on account of Gunda the Hurtian, 
3. u4 hu-ur5-ti{ki}-ta i3-im-gen-na-a 
#tr.en: when he came from Hurti. 
4. giri3 it-ra-ak-i3-li2 sukkal 
#tr.en: Conveyer : Itrak-ili, the messenger. 
@reverse 
1. szu-ru-usz-ki-in szagina maszkim 
#tr.en: Šuruš-kin, the general, was guarantor. 
2. iti u4 2(u) 4(disz) ba-zal 
#tr.en: The 24th day of the month has passed. 
3. ki {d}szul-gi-a-a-mu-ta ba-zi 
#tr.en: Booked out of Šulgi-a'amu(’s account ). 
4. iti ezem-mah 2(disz)-kam 
#tr.en: 2nd “great festival” month (10th, intercalary month, Drehem calendar) 
5. mu en-mah-gal-an-na en {d}nanna ba-hun 
#tr.en: year: “Enmahgalanna was installed as priestess of Nanna” (Amar-Suen 4). 
@left 
1. 2(disz) 
#tr.en: 2 (sheep) 

